{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101268","id":2265426040,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6HB6h4","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101268","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101268.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101268.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101268","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101268/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101268/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101268/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9eacdcdebc1c1fc311fb08c89d6ac04e872521f3","number":101268,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Optionally use fpng encoder for much faster movie writing","user":{"login":"akx","id":58669,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58669?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akx","html_url":"https://github.com/akx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR proposes a compile-time flag to use [fpng](https://github.com/richgel999/fpng/) for PNG encoding instead of libpng.\r\n\r\nOn my machine (2023 Macbook Pro, M2 Max, 64 GB memory, macOS 15.2), there's a **15-fold** difference in rendering speed for movie maker mode, and I'm now able to write these videos at almost realtime 50 FPS speed.\r\n\r\nThe downside is that `fpng` only supports encoding RGB and RGBA frames, which is why this is disabled by default.\r\n\r\n### No fpng (`scons dev_mode=yes no_editor_splash=yes fpng=no`) \r\n\r\n```\r\nGodot Engine v4.4.dev.custom_build.f9f599aa5 (2025-01-08 07:22:55 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\r\nMetal 3.2 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: Apple - Apple M2 Max (Apple8)\r\n\r\nMovie Maker mode enabled, recording movie at 50 FPS...\r\n2025-01-08 09:35:02.707 godot.macos.editor.arm64.nofpng[32266:3401569] +[IMKClient subclass]: chose IMKClient_Modern\r\n2025-01-08 09:35:04.456 godot.macos.editor.arm64.nofpng[32266:3401569] +[IMKInputSession subclass]: chose IMKInputSession_Modern\r\n----------------\r\nDone recording movie at path: /.../XX/frame.png\r\n451 frames at 50 FPS (movie length: 00.0:00.0:09.0), recorded in 00.0:02.0:15.0 (6% of real-time speed).\r\nCPU time: 0.03 seconds (average: 0.06 ms/frame)\r\nGPU time: 0.00 seconds (average: 0.00 ms/frame)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Yes fpng (`scons dev_mode=yes no_editor_splash=yes fpng=yes`) \r\n\r\n```\r\nGodot Engine v4.4.dev.custom_build.3d0cb67ad (2025-01-08 06:58:20 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\r\nMetal 3.2 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: Apple - Apple M2 Max (Apple8)\r\n\r\nMovie Maker mode enabled, recording movie at 50 FPS...\r\n2025-01-08 09:39:39.064 godot.macos.editor.arm64.fpng[33081:3415884] +[IMKClient subclass]: chose IMKClient_Modern\r\n2025-01-08 09:39:40.891 godot.macos.editor.arm64.fpng[33081:3415884] +[IMKInputSession subclass]: chose IMKInputSession_Modern\r\n----------------\r\nDone recording movie at path: /.../XX/frame.png\r\n451 frames at 50 FPS (movie length: 00.0:00.0:09.0), recorded in 00.0:00.0:10.0 (90% of real-time speed).\r\nCPU time: 0.02 seconds (average: 0.04 ms/frame)\r\nGPU time: 0.00 seconds (average: 0.00 ms/frame)\r\n----------------\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-01-08T07:44:45Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T12:52:49Z","closed_at":"2026-08-11T12:33:28Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"akx:fpng","ref":"fpng","repo":{"id":740161518,"node_id":"R_kgDOLB337g","name":"godot","full_name":"akx/godot","owner":{"login":"akx","id":58669,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent